  "sourceRequirements": {
    "summary": "Nature publishes short, high-impact reports for a broad scientific readership; Methods are appended after the references and don't count toward the body limit.\n\nDistilled requirements: Body up to 3,000 words; abstract up to 150 words; up to 6 figures; up to 30 references; required sections: Introduction, Methods, Results, Discussion; Vancouver citation style.\n\nAlso required: Cover letter required; No subheadings within the Abstract; Online Methods appended after references (not counted in word limit).\n\nThis summary is the app's distillation \u2014 open the author instructions above to confirm against the journal's current text.",
